Package: msalfpr
Title: Demographic Decomposition of Labor Force Participation for One MSA
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("King", "Banaian", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Rebuilds the econvitals.org demographic-detail analysis of labor
    force participation and employment-population ratios for a single
    metropolitan area, using ACS 1- and 5-year tables and BLS LAUS.
